{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_3.json|/dataList/14/desc","kr_sha":"c7f547c8b156515284ea647dea73c49f569c8ba8f3f6bc279a319c03829c6fe9","zh":"- 至少我們的罪人所使用的E.G.O，應該是透過將作為媒介的異想體的感情或自我據為己有來使用的。\n雖然我也沒親身體驗過……\n- 我已耳聞多次那種感覺，就像是被他人的想法所濡染後將其反映到自己的人生當中一樣。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_3.json|/dataList/14/id","kr_sha":"a0627d5985aeaf3bfe9926091b5a1f0fdd60d0a9c11eaacc0c083533fae99524","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_59","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_3.json|/dataList/14/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_3.json|/dataList/15/desc","kr_sha":"67cab732028715015aff848441250c46aa6feee45a42fbc73435c8878f7c2d1c","zh":"- 這到底是如何運作的呢？難以憑藉邏輯或古典物理來解釋這一點，似乎是它們共有的特徵。\n雖然浮士德說過，以我現在的狀態而言，沒有必要那麼努力地去試圖理解它們……\n但我並不覺得，像什麼斷臂肉芽迅速生長復原、貼上貼紙就能讓運氣變好之類的現象，是能被輕易忽視的。\n- ……等下，那我的頭不會也是奇點吧？","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_3.json|/dataList/15/id","kr_sha":"20462c54d807abfdd4256835287d96c503cd6b90310b7789ae68053bd6341010","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_60","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_3.json|/dataList/15/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_3.json|/dataList/16/desc","kr_sha":"2146ce7de00a319d7d34da28af37f8d9d0c9ddd9022a691efe4db391c7f0d7ae","zh":"- 當罪人們靠近這東西時，他們似乎會產生與頭暈類似的異常感覺。\n這種現象也被稱為「共鳴」，這可能與引發我頭痛的原理相似。\n- 每當金枝回收完畢，維吉里烏斯便會通知其他部門的人員對其進行處理。\n當我問到這件事時，他只會說「將會呈遞給本部」。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
